:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the enemy, see [[Dark Lazer (Enemy)]].''
'''Dom Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that can be purchased for 150 [[Cat Food]] in the [[Upgrade Menu]] after completing [[Greenland (Empire of Cats)|Greenland]] in [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 1. She was added in [[Version 1.0 Update|Version 1.0]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 3.3 Update|Version 3.3]] increases attack speed, removes [[Multi-Hit]] and gains [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] target. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 10.0 Update|Version 10.0]]. In [[The Battle Cats POP!]], she is unlocked from clearing Gunma in chapter 2 and costs 16000 XP. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], she is available once beating Greenland in the Empire of Cats chapter and costs 75 Cat Food.

